  "limitations": [
    "Short single-prompt comparison, not a statistically controlled multi-workload throughput claim",
    "First use is not disk-cold; page and JIT caches were not cleared",
    "Warm retains model/cache/history but creates fresh request state; not necessarily steady-state residency",
    "Host RAM guards are sampled soft checks, not hard OS limits; cgroup ancestors are not inspected",
    "Recorded memory_plan estimates single-token decode, not multi-token prefill peak workspace",
    "Private pool observations exclude driver/context/global allocations and are not whole-device peak VRAM",
    "memory_observation_ms excludes the final out-of-request state-release sample",
    "Host stage/worker intervals overlap and are not isolated GPU kernel time",
    "Real quantized independent-reference strict numerical equivalence remains unestablished",
    "Qwen chat framing, longer contexts, serving load and Qwen3.8/SSD/ngram paths remain unvalidated or deferred"
